WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:03.830
You're building your app with Claude Code, and it's almost done.

2
00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:06.610
Then that message pops up: limit reached.

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:12.290
Either you wait until Wednesday, or you buy a pricier subscription, again in dollars.

4
00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.460
And meanwhile your project stands still.

5
00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:16.280
The fix has two layers.

6
00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:20.830
The subscription does the thinking, HisarWeb AI does the work.

7
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:26.860
One key, all models: Claude, GPT, Gemini.

8
00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:30.230
All at exactly half the official price.

9
00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.960
In Claude Code you only change the address and the key.

10
00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:37.650
One tip: don't switch models in the middle of a session.

11
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:39.980
A step-by-step guide is on screen.

12
00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:41.280
You stay in control.

13
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:43.000
HisarWeb AI.

